  answer: Academy of Ancient Music
  acceptedAnswers:
  - Academy of Ancient Music
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABStabat Mater: 1. Stabat Mater\xBB, de
    1989, y llega hasta 2013."
  - "\xABConcerto in D Minor for Two Violins, BWV 1043: Concerto in D Minor for Two
    Violins, BWV 1043: II. Largo ma non tanto\xBB presenta una energ\xEDa suave y
    un pulso cercano a 121 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABRinaldo, HWV 7a / Act 2: \"Lascia ch'io pianga\"\xBB
    y \xABConcerto in D Minor for Two Violins, BWV 1043: Concerto in D Minor for
    Two Violins, BWV 1043: I. Vivace\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABNulla in mundo pax, RV 630: 1. Nulla in mundo pax\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABRequiem, K. 626: Lacrimosa\xBB y \xABVivaldi:
    Gloria in D Major, RV 589: I. Gloria in excelsis Deo\xBB."
